Megatron Core CPU-offload checkpoint recovery
Base: NVIDIA/Megatron-LM dc0ee41ada177d4c74ba46bb501bba5967264815 (core_r0.18.0)

Restore native FP32 execution copies, Adam counters and dp-zero master weights.
The GPU group-counter change is from NVIDIA/Megatron-LM PR #7785,
commit ccc454f5cc4cdc1ecbea56cdec77d6ddd0225a62.
Related upstream restore work: https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/pull/7449
Counter fix: https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/pull/7785
Validated with Torch-format TP2/SP Actor/Critic resume and partial/full CPU
optimizer offload regressions. Other checkpoint formats are not covered.

